{"id":448,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"A most gallant-looking creature. It emits energy waves and controls them with precision, using them to sense even faraway beings. I have given the name ”aura” to this power."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"It can tell what people are thinking. Only Trainers who have justice in their hearts can earn this Pokémon’s trust."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"It controls waves known as auras, which are powerful enough to pulverize huge rocks. It uses these waves to take down its prey."},{"games":["Ultra Moon"],"text":"Lucario reads its opponent’s feelings with its aura waves. It finds out things it would rather not know, so it gets stressed out easily."},{"games":["Ultra Sun"],"text":"It concentrates its mental energy and fires off mysterious waves called auras, which can crush boulders of large size to dust."},{"games":["Moon"],"text":"They can detect the species of a living being— and its emotions—from over half a mile away. They control auras and hunt their prey in packs."},{"games":["Sun"],"text":"Not only does it perceive auras, but it has also gained the power to control them. It employs them in battle."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Y","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"By reading the auras of all things, it can tell how others are feeling from over half a mile away."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","X","Pearl"],"text":"By catching the aura emanating from others, it can read their thoughts and movements."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"A well-trained one can sense auras to identify and take in the feelings of creatures over half a mile away."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It’s said that no foe can remain invisible to LUCARIO, since it can detect auras. Even foes it could not otherwise see."},{"games":["Diamond"],"text":"It has the ability to sense the auras of all things. It understands human speech."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Steadfast","hidden":false,"description":"The Pokémon's determination boosts 